              "actionableFix": "Include a de-identified version of the dataset and all analysis scripts in a public repository (e.g., OSF, GitHub) or state why this is not possible.",
              "reentryPoint": "qa",
              "deterministicVerification": null,
              "confidence": 0.7
            },
            {
