              "actionableFix": "Phrase limitations in standard scientific language (e.g., 'This study is observational and cannot prove causality; results may not generalize beyond the study population.') without referencing the review process itself.",
              "reentryPoint": "manuscript",
              "deterministicVerification": null,
              "confidence": 0.6
            }
          ],
